Description: MoaT network inventory database
 Database-backed network inventory for MoaT, migrated from the legacy
 DistKV inventory (moat.kv.inv) to a moat.db.inv SQLAlchemy + Alembic
 submodule.
 .
 Manages VLANs, IP networks, hosts, interfaces, addresses, cables,
 wires, and host groups.
